// °x (prefix) anchors ABOVE the nearest loop — survives loop end and crosses sequential loops

// °x survives first loop; second loop continues accumulation
@ i:1..3 { °x += i }
@ j:1..3 { °x += j }
>> x ¶

// °arr accumulates across two sequential loops
@ i:1..3 { °arr = °arr$+ i }
@ j:4..5 { °arr = °arr$+ j }
>> arr ¶
